  "changelog": "1.0.2: description renamed in the EthOS 2.0 naming. 1.0.1: requires EthOS 2.0. 1.0.0: first release. Face detection for movie thumbnails moves out of the EthOS core into this package (OpenCV ~130 MB stays out of the core venv). File Station calls it locally and falls back to the first valid frame when it is not installed.",
